On dlvls:0-7 there are no polytraps, so shape-shifter are the likely
explanation. Inspection of the dumplogs of the ~200 low-level deaths
showed that 10% of the deaths were caused by reading cursed scrolls
of genocide early. All the rest must be from shape-changers - or are
there any other options? - Well, yes, potions of polymorph drunk by
monsters, but those should be very rare events. On dlvls:0-3 there
are 15 minotaur deaths, about half of those from reading genocide
scrolls. Can chameleons appear that early?

